silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_07_backend_routing_observability_sections_01_routing_as_functor_concrete_anchor_6#mittensforgeroutingfunctor silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensForgeRoutingFunctor is In section 'Routing as a Functor' the bare symbol colim(T circ D_Mittens) anchors to MittensForgeRoutingFunctor: The routing functor R: F_04 to Backend that sends each typed source leg to a backend write target while preserving the leg's Yoneda profile (incoming and outgoing arrows)." .
